<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 4.05 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 4.05 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 4.05 percent in the week ended August 2 from 4.02 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES   Aug 2, 1997  July 26, 1997  Aug 3, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +4.05	   +4.02	   +5.98</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)   326.3	   325.9	   313.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended August 3, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi Newsroom (91) 11-301-2024; Fax (91) 11-301-4043</p>
</text>
